            "rationale": "The renewal rule (overdue, then limit, then holds, in order) is decided once, in Tier 2 `Loans.renewalRefusal`. `renew` and `renewAll` both reuse it, so `loans`, `renew` and `renew-all` cannot disagree. Tier 3 `renewalReason` only turns the Tier 2 refusal value into display text, using the limit carried in the error. The CLI only renders views. No Tier 3/4 site re-derives any part of the rule.",
